                            10
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْثَقَ مِنْهُ</span></b> 
                         [<i>He secured himself against
him,</i> by a bond or the like, or absolutely:] <i>he
took,</i> or <i>received, a bond</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثِيقَة</span>) <i>from him.</i> (S,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُكْتُبُوهُ ٱسْتِيثَاقًا وَدَفْعًا لِلنِّزَاعِ</span> [<i>Write ye it,</i>
(namely, the debt,) <i>for</i> the creditor's <i>self-securing,
and for preventing contention</i>]. (Jel, ii. 282.)
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَظْهَرَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْثَقَ مِنَ البَابِ</span>
                        <i>He closed the
door firmly.</i> (MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْثَقَ مِنْ أُمُورِهِ</span>: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْنَجَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَوْثَقَ مِنَ المَالِ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوثج</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6- 
